AI: ROOT CAUSE                                                                      

 • Faulty component: Pod frontend-proxy-7b7cd5fb4-lqwtd (Deployment             
   frontend‑proxy).                                                             
 • Failure: The container was terminated with OOMKilled (exitCode 137) and      
   entered a CrashLoopBackOff.                                                  
 • Why it breaks the application: The frontend‑proxy is the entry point for all 
   user traffic. When it is repeatedly killed for out‑of‑memory, the proxy      
   cannot forward requests to the downstream services (e.g., checkout,          
   recommendation). This produced the flood of “connection refused” errors seen 
   in the frontend logs and caused downstream failures such as the “shipping    
   quote failure” and overall unavailability of the OpenTelemetry Demo Astronomy
   Shop.                                                                        

